t":43,"url":51,"id":52,"edit":53},{"width":48,"height":49},300,35,"ParcelShop","location-hub.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffe17a06d-e7e7-4fc4-9e0d-6daba77f1132_parcelshop.svg","YhYpMBIAAC0A0QBt",{"x":54,"y":54,"zoom":55,"background":56},0,1,"#fff",{},{"link_type":18},"page_header$08e76f9d-a9d1-4991-bac1-511d942a288a","page_header",{"variation":62,"version":25,"items":63,"primary":102,"id":105,"slice_type":106,"slice_label":43},"listComponent",[64,78,90],{"title":65,"content":66,"icon":70},"ParcelShops",[67],{"type":33,"text":68,"spans":69,"direction":36},"Convenient local shops where you can quickly hand over your parcel during extended opening hours, making it easy to fit sending parcels around your day. ",[],{"dimensions":71,"alt":73,"copyright":43,"url":74,"id":75,"edit":76},{"width":72,"height":72},40,"Icon of a courier","location-hub.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff67d24e2-931f-4df2-b583-2c51af7d6cf4_courier3.svg","Yh96FhIAACkA-Zr4",{"x":54,"y":54,"zoom":55,"background":77},"transparent",{"title":79,"content":80,"icon":84},"Lockers",[81],{"type":33,"text":82,"spans":83,"direction":36},"Secure self-service lockers that let you drop off parcels at any time. Perfect for flexibility and contact-free. Available 24\u002F7 at selected locations.",[],{"dimensions":85,"alt":86,"copyright":43,"url":87,"id":88,"edit":89},{"width":72,"height":72},"Parcel icon","location-hub.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F15159101-ea95-4f4d-8762-549a8e631c4f_parcel3.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsn",{"x":54,"y":54,"zoom":55,"background":77},{"title":91,"content":92,"icon":96},"Post Office Branches",[93],{"type":33,"text":94,"spans":95,"direction":36},"A wide network of participating branches where you can drop off parcels whilst running other errands. Use the location finder to check which branches in your area accept Evri parcels.  ",[],{"dimensions":97,"alt":98,"copyright":43,"url":99,"id":100,"edit":101},{"width":72,"height":72},"Parcelshop icon","location-hub.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F6fb8763e-f02b-40b7-8e67-a916528bac93_parcelshop.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsl",{"x":54,"y":54,"zoom":55,"background":77},{"theme":29,"title":103,"description":104},"Where can I drop off a parcel?","Evri offers multiple parcel drop-off and collection options across the UK, giving you the flexibility and convenience wherever you are. Each option is designed to make sending and returning parcels simple. \nYou can drop off your parcel at:","list_block$45b525fe-3c19-409d-8ab4-76bc96642dc5","list_block",{"variation":108,"version":25,"items":109,"primary":177,"id":181,"slice_type":182,"slice_label":43},"3Column",[110,133,155],{"Title":111,"Description":116,"Image":120,"Label":43,"UrlText":128,"Url":129,"buttonDataGtmTrack":43,"SecondaryButtonText":43,"SecondaryButtonUrl":132,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":43,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[112],{"type":113,"text":114,"spans":115,"direction":36},"heading3","ParcelShops ",[],[117],{"type":33,"text":118,"spans":119,"direction":36},"Our ParcelShops are located inside local convenience stores, newsagents and supermarkets across the UK. Our ParcelShops are open 7 days a week, with a FREE Print-In-ParcelShop device. Simply book your parcel online, take in your QR code or booking confirmation and drop it off at the counter.  ",[],{"dimensions":121,"alt":124,"copyright":43,"url":125,"id":126,"edit":127},{"width":122,"height":123},1000,666,"Customer stood outside of a ParcelShop store smiling and holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront.","location-hub.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7b6kZ7c43Q3f_73_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2847-1-.jpg?auto=format,compress","Z7b6kZ7c43Q3f_73",{"x":54,"y":54,"zoom":55,"background":77},"Find out more about ParcelShops",{"link_type":39,"key":130,"url":131},"12de5f9d-77d2-414c-9eff-0ac7adbc5ce2","location-hub.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":45},{"Title":134,"Description":138,"Image":142,"Label":43,"UrlText":150,"Url":151,"buttonDataGtmTrack":43,"SecondaryButtonText":43,"SecondaryButtonUrl":154,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":43,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[135],{"type":113,"text":136,"spans":137,"direction":36},"Evri Lockers ",[],[139],{"type":33,"text":140,"spans":141,"direction":36},"Need to drop off your parcel outside normal shop hours? Our Lockers are available 24\u002F7 at selected locations across the UK. Lockers are a fully automated self-service, making it quick and contactless for your parcels.  ",[],{"dimensions":143,"alt":146,"copyright":43,"url":147,"id":148,"edit":149},{"width":144,"height":145},1200,628,"A person wearing headphones places a parcel into a blue Evri Locker unit outside a modern building in an urban area.","location-hub.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FagSEu6YofJOwHMcU_Asset3_1200x628.jpg?auto=format,compress","agSEu6YofJOwHMcU",{"x":54,"y":54,"zoom":55,"background":77},"Find out more about Lockers",{"link_type":39,"key":152,"url":153},"870f018e-a2d2-478e-ba57-a467b8d68f12","location-hub.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":45},{"Title":156,"Description":160,"Image":164,"Label":43,"UrlText":172,"Url":173,"buttonDataGtmTrack":43,"SecondaryButtonText":43,"SecondaryButtonUrl":176,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":43,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[157],{"type":113,"text":158,"spans":159,"direction":36},"Post Office parcel drop-off",[],[161],{"type":33,"text":162,"spans":163,"direction":36},"You can also drop off Evri parcels at participating Post Office branches across the UK, giving you even more local options for your parcel drop-off and collection. As well as being able to book your Evri parcel online, in our participating Post Office branches you can book and pay in store for your parcel.  ",[],{"dimensions":165,"alt":168,"copyright":43,"url":169,"id":170,"edit":171},{"width":166,"height":167},8256,6192,"Post Office ParcelShop","location-hub.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F19e68f6f-ac0d-4bce-b8c7-db5227dbfa2f_Option+1.jpg?auto=format,compress","ZgKfWhAAACkAd80m",{"x":54,"y":54,"zoom":55,"background":77},"Find out about our Post Office branches",{"link_type":39,"key":174,"url":175},"2b6722aa-9ced-4d8f-bcc2-00b72081a0d4","location-hub.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fpost-office-services",{"link_type":45},{"SectionTitle":178,"SectionDescription":179,"theme":180},[],[],"neutral","article_link_module$3ee95c4c-073d-4180-88fb-0450137886e3","article_link_module",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":184,"primary":185,"id":206,"slice_type":207,"slice_label":43},[],{"title":186,"bodyText":187,"isEco":20,"PaddingTop":194,"PaddingBottom":194,"NoMarginBottom":20,"hasButton":194,"buttonText":195,"buttonLink":196,"image":198},"Ready to send or collect a parcel?",[188,191],{"type":33,"text":189,"spans":190,"direction":36},"Your nearest ParcelShop, Locker or Post Office is just a search away. ",[],{"type":33,"text":192,"spans":193,"direction":36},"Search by postcode, town, or area and see all available options near you, with opening times and services included.  ",[],true,"Use the Evri Location Finder",{"link_type":39,"key":197,"url":41},"5f5bcb00-6b03-408d-9066-b47ec3360b6b",{"dimensions":199,"alt":201,"copyright":43,"url":202,"id":203,"edit":204},{"width":122,"height":200},665,"Evri blue ParcelShop sign hung from the ceiling of a store in one of the aisles. Stock on shelves is visible in the background.","location-hub.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4",{"x":54,"y":205,"zoom":55,"background":77},8,"feature_banner$cb25cdcd-dbaa-4fdb-ac96-900df33a1dfe","feature_banner",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":209,"primary":247,"id":249,"slice_type":250,"slice_label":43},[210,221,231,237],{"questionTitle":211,"questionBody":212},"Can I drop off my Evri parcels at any Post Office?",[213],{"type":33,"text":214,"spans":215,"direction":36},"Only participating Post Office branches accept Evri parcels. Check the Location Finder before visiting.  ",[216],{"start":217,"end":218,"type":219,"data":220},71,86,"hyperlink",{"link_type":39,"url":41,"target":42},{"questionTitle":222,"questionBody":223},"Do I need to print a label before drop-off?",[224],{"type":33,"text":225,"spans":226,"direction":36},"Many ParcelShops offer Print in ParcelShop services. You can use the Location Finder to see which ParcelShops near you offer this service.  ",[227],{"start":228,"end":229,"type":219,"data":230},69,84,{"link_type":39,"url":41,"target":42},{"questionTitle":232,"questionBody":233},"Can I drop off multiple parcels at the same location?",[234],{"type":33,"text":235,"spans":236,"direction":36},"Yes, most ParcelShops, Lockers and participating Post Office branches accept multiple parcels in one visit. Just make sure to have your QR code or labels ready so that your parcel can be processed easily. ",[],{"questionTitle":238,"questionBody":239},"What if the locker is too small for my parcel?",[240],{"type":33,"text":241,"spans":242,"direction":36},"The first Locker door that will open will always be the smallest available. If you need a larger Locker box, press “change box size” on the main screen of the Locker and select the most appropriate size for your parcel. If your parcel is too big for the largest Locker, take it to a ParcelShop or participating Post Office branch, where the size limits will be more flexible for you. Find somewhere to drop off your parcel in the Location Finder.  ",[243],{"start":244,"end":245,"type":219,"data":246},430,446,{"link_type":39,"url":41,"target":42},{"title":248},"Evri drop-off locations FAQs","frequently_asked_questions$b79dc60e-f17e-4706-a234-549ce176dd19","frequently_asked_questions",[23,61,107,183,208],["Reactive",253],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":254,"$sclient